# Citation metadata — GitHub renders this as "Cite this repository".
#
# The abstract deliberately carries the scope statement, the same way
# PulseMask's does. Someone who encounters this work only as a citation, with
# no access to the running app, still learns that its figures are a fixture
# rather than a result. Keep that in any edit; it is the same guardrail the
# interface itself carries on every view.
cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Aurelius Learn: a browser-native assembly training runtime with procedural part geometry"
